<Border xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Tag="FullBleedBriefing" BorderBrush="#92968C" BorderThickness="1" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch">
  <Border.Resources>
    <Style TargetType="{x:Type TextBlock}">
      <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="/Assets/Resources/ui/fonts/#Special Elite"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#49677F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="18"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="Normal"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="24"/>
      <Setter Property="LineStackingStrategy" Value="BlockLineHeight"/>
    </Style>
  </Border.Resources>
  <Border.Background>
    <LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="1,0.8">
      <GradientStop Color="#DADCD5" Offset="0"/>
      <GradientStop Color="#F0F0E8" Offset="0.32"/>
      <GradientStop Color="#E7E9E2" Offset="0.76"/>
      <GradientStop Color="#D4D8D1" Offset="1"/>
    </LinearGradientBrush>
  </Border.Background>
  <Grid>
    <Canvas IsHitTestVisible="False" ClipToBounds="True">
      <Ellipse Canvas.Left="13" Canvas.Top="39" Width="10" Height="13" Fill="#616456"/>
      <Path Stroke="#9A9F94" StrokeThickness="1" Data="M 18,39 L 14,28 15,14 11,2"/>
      <Ellipse Canvas.Left="13" Canvas.Top="76" Width="10" Height="13" Fill="#616456"/>
      <Path Stroke="#D3D6CA" StrokeThickness="1.5" Data="M 13,83 C 14,89 20,90 24,85"/>
    </Canvas>
    <Border Width="2" Background="#9A9F94" Opacity="0.09" HorizontalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False"/>
    <Border Width="1" Background="#FFFFFF" Opacity="0.32" HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="4,0,0,0" IsHitTestVisible="False"/>
    <Border Height="1" Background="#9A9F94" Opacity="0.12" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False"/>
    <StackPanel Margin="38,30,28,30">
      <Border BorderBrush="#A24F4E" BorderThickness="1.5" Padding="14,7" Margin="0,0,5,26"
              HorizontalAlignment="Right" Opacity="0.8" RenderTransformOrigin="0.5,0.5">
        <Border.RenderTransform><RotateTransform Angle="-2"/></Border.RenderTransform>
        <Border.OpacityMask>
          <LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="0.2,1">
            <GradientStop Color="#E0000000" Offset="0"/>
            <GradientStop Color="#B0000000" Offset="0.32"/>
            <GradientStop Color="#F0000000" Offset="0.35"/>
            <GradientStop Color="#B0000000" Offset="0.71"/>
            <GradientStop Color="#E0000000" Offset="1"/>
          </LinearGradientBrush>
        </Border.OpacityMask>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="SECRET" TextAlignment="Center" Foreground="#A24F4E" FontSize="20"/>
          <TextBlock Text="EXCLUSIVE" TextAlignment="Center" Foreground="#A24F4E" FontSize="20"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>
      <TextBlock TextDecorations="Underline" FontSize="20" LineHeight="26" Margin="0,0,0,18">
OPERATION CORPORATE - CARRIERS AT WAR
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,22">
FROM: ADMIRAL SIR JOHN FIELDHOUSE, CINCFLEET
    <LineBreak/>
    TO: REAR ADMIRAL S. J. WOODWARD
    <LineBreak/>
    2 MAY 1982
      </TextBlock>
      <Border Height="1" Background="#7F939E" Opacity="0.45" Margin="0,0,0,22"/>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
Time Zone Used Throughout the Order: ZULU.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="1. SITUATION:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> Argentine forces are converging on the Task Force. ARA 25 DE MAYO and her escorts are approaching from the northwest, while land-based strike aircraft may attack from the south. The enemy appears intent on striking from more than one direction to divide our defences.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="2. MISSION:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> Sink ARA 25 DE MAYO. Keep HMS INVINCIBLE afloat throughout the action and for thirty minutes after the Argentine carrier is sunk. Maintain the escort screen and fighter cover until that period has elapsed.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="3. EXECUTION:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> Maintain radar surveillance of the northwestern and southern approaches. Launch Sea Harrier patrols and keep a reserve ready to intercept. Position the escorts to support one another with missile fire and maintain an anti-submarine screen. Use Sea King helicopters to investigate suspected submarine contacts. Take sea room to the east if necessary to keep the carrier clear of converging attacks.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="4. THREAT:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> 25 DE MAYO carries A-4Q Skyhawks and S-2 Trackers, with HERCULES, SANTISIMA TRINIDAD and COMODORO PY in company. Land-based Super Etendards armed with Exocet missiles and A-4 strike aircraft may coordinate their approach with the carrier group. An Argentine submarine may be operating on the approaches. Mainland airfields at RIO GRANDE and RIO GALLEGOS support the land-based strikes. Treat search aircraft as a warning that the carrier position may have been reported.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="5. SERVICE SUPPORT:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> Ammunition and fuel are limited. Retain fighters and missile ammunition for fleet defence, recover returning aircraft promptly and avoid committing the carrier to pursuit of enemy surface units.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run>J. D. E. FIELDHOUSE</Run>
    <LineBreak/>
    Admiral, Commander-in-Chief Fleet
      </TextBlock>
      <Border Height="1" Background="#7F939E" Opacity="0.35" Margin="0,4,0,18"/>
      <TextBlock Text="SECRET / EXCLUSIVE" TextAlignment="Center" FontSize="16" Foreground="#617A8C"/>
    </StackPanel>
  </Grid>
</Border>
